      "content": "Your desire to put your wife and children first, even if it means sacrificing your own well-being, speaks to an immense and selfless love that I deeply respect. However, the solution to their suffering may not be a \"sacrifice\" but a path with professional help to restructure debts and manage mental health under a doctor's guidance. Please speak with a lifeline counselor to ensure you are hearing a professional, trusted perspective on how to stay safe today.",
